# Real source extraction and deterministic Map. No model or source execution.
name: Map consumers preserve source framework facts and expose the real diagram
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/map_functionality.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
expect: Map 1/3
expect-not: Map ✓
ask: Does existing Map evidence remain readable without being accepted or advancing the investigation automatically?
submit: scene
require-live-snap: 20 DATA-FLOW DIAGRAM | real-dfd
expect: PARTIAL
ask: Does the actual deterministic Map show a source-grounded diagram without presenting it as validated model context?
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 ENTRY POINTS | entry-points
require-live-snap: 20 Flask | flask-source
expect: /health
expect: @web.get
ask: Does the selected route lead with source evidence, distinguish catalog facts from model annotations, and retain complete provenance through clear paging and back controls?
keys: Down
require-live-snap: 20 FastAPI | fastapi-source
expect: /notes
resize: 160x48
live-snap: route-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: route-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: route-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: route-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: route-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: route-tail-40x12
ask: Are the selected route and all evidence reachable at 40x12, with clear paging, return controls and honest catalog/model receipts?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 KUZUSHI | restored-origin
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/map_functionality.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
expect: Map 1/3
expect-not: Map ✓
submit: scene
require-live-snap: 20 DATA-FLOW DIAGRAM | restored-dfd
expect: PARTIAL
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 Flask | restored-source-facts
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/map_functionality.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does no-color restart restore the same source facts and source-grounded Map while source bytes and zero provider consumption remain unchanged?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 KUZUSHI | restarted-origin
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
